---
source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: scss/value/parity-attr-css-only-contexts.scss
---

# Input

```scss
$name:data-width;$x:2px;$fn:var;
@container card attr(data-width px, 2px){.a{color:red}}
@container card unknown(attr(data-x type(<length>), var(--x, 2px))){.b{height:1px}}
@container card attr(#{$name} px, 2px){.c{color:green}}
@container card attr(data-label, /* empty */){.d{color:blue}}
@container card attr(data-x px, $x){.e{padding:1px}}
@container card attr(data-x px, #{$fn}(--x, 2px)){.f{height:2px}}

```


# Formatted

```scss
$name: data-width;
$x: 2px;
$fn: var;
@container card attr(data-width px, 2px) {
	.a {
		color: red;
	}
}
@container card unknown(attr(data-x type(<length>), var(--x, 2px))) {
	.b {
		height: 1px;
	}
}
@container card attr(#{$name} px, 2px) {
	.c {
		color: green;
	}
}
@container card attr(data-label, /* empty */) {
	.d {
		color: blue;
	}
}
@container card attr(data-x px, $x) {
	.e {
		padding: 1px;
	}
}
@container card attr(data-x px, #{$fn}(--x, 2px)) {
	.f {
		height: 2px;
	}
}

```
